THE COMPANY, WITHIN THE LIMITS OF THE LAW AND PROVIDED WITH THE DUE AUTHORIZATIONS, HAS THE PURPOSE OF THE FOLLOWING ACTIVITIES:
- CREATION AND CREATION OF INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS IN THE SECTORS IT AND TELECOMMUNICATIONS AND IN PARTICULAR IN A "MOBILE" ENVIRONMENT;
- MANAGEMENT, ORGANIZATIONAL AND MANAGEMENT ASSISTANCE ACTIVITIES, WITH PARTICULAR REFERENCE TO THE INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY AND TELECOMMUNICATIONS SECTOR;
- DESIGN, CREATION AND MANAGEMENT OF IT SYSTEMS, DELIVERY OF INSTALLATION, DISTRIBUTION, TRAINING, MAINTENANCE AND ASSISTANCE SERVICES;
- MARKETING OF OWN AND/OR THIRD PARTY HARDWARE AND SOFTWARE PRODUCTS IN THE COMPUTING AND TELECOMMUNICATIONS SECTOR.

D.S. Consult s.a.s.&ndash; founded in 2009 - is a company of studies and economic researches, specialised in evaluation of programs and projects of investment, in the elaboration of territorial and sectorial analysis and in the redaction of investigations, market research and forecasts of economic aggregates. The society develops its activity on behalf of public and private clients: international agencies, administrations of the State, private companies, engineering companies, banking firms, universities and research centres.The companycan provide services of:
- Identification, Design, Formulation, Evaluation (ex-ante, intermediate, final and impact) of investment programs and projects;
- Sectoral and territorial studies;
- Cost / benefit analysis and feasibility studies of development programs and projects funded by International Donors (European Commission, World Bank, InterAmerican Development Bank, African Development Bank, Asian Development Bank, Agence Fran&ccedil;aise de D&eacute;veloppement,...);
- Extensive experience and leadership in technical assistance to transport programs and commercial exchanges;
- Evaluation of investment programs, from the macro and micro-economic point of view, according to EC criteria;
- Experienced in formulation of EU funded infrastructural projects and TA programs (6 studies in Dominican Republic, Haiti and Ethiopia), according to the PCM methodologies;
- Strong knowledge of transport sector in the West Africa Area.
The company uses methodologies and particularly advanced technical tools, having internally developed software for simulation and forecast, in the economic and financial analysis, and for the elaboration of economic forecasts.
D.S. Consult can operate in multiple sectors:
- Transportation and Infrastructure
- Tourism and Cultural Heritage
- Territory and Environment
- Economic forecasts
- Training.
The company has a wide international experience, over 40 projects in 20 countries in Africa, Asia, Central/Eastern Europe, European Union, the Middle East and South America funded by African Development Bank, DFID, the European Commission, the World Bank and private sector clients (amongst others: Armenia, Azerbaijan, Barbados, Benin, Dominican Republic, Ethiopia, Georgia, Ghana, Guyana, Haiti, Italy, Jordan, Mauritius, Morocco, Niger, Nigeria, Senegal, Sierra Leone, South Sudan, Turkey, Uruguay, Zambia).
